### House Robber (can't rob adjacent)
```java
public int rob(int[] nums) {
    int prev2 = 0, prev1 = 0;
    for (int n : nums) {
        int cur = Math.max(prev1, prev2 + n);
        prev2 = prev1; prev1 = cur;
    }
    return prev1;
}
